1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,041
Collenchyma.

2
00:00:01,041 --> 00:00:08,333
It is alive, and its walls are rich in pectin and not lignified, so it can stretch as the organ grows.

3
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:17,304
Sclerenchyma is the tempting answer, but its lignified walls are rigid and its cells are dead: it supports organs that have finished growing.

